Below is the complete **HI-TECH College website footer implementation** using React, TypeScript and CSS. It follows the design reference, including the navy, red, cream and gold colour scheme.

It includes:

- College logo and institutional description.
- College statistics and social media.
- Quick links and academic services.
- Contact information and campus image.
- Newsletter subscription interface.
- Student and staff portal links.
- Accreditation section.
- Privacy, terms and accessibility links.
- Responsive mobile navigation.
- Floating Dr.IT chatbot and back-to-top button.

