## **3. Install the icon library**

From `apps/web`:

```
npm install lucide-react
```

## **4. Add the footer to your website**

In your main layout, for example `apps/web/src/layouts/PublicLayout.tsx`:

```

import React from "react";
import Footer from "../components/layout/Footer";

interface PublicLayoutProps {
  children: React.ReactNode;
}

export default function PublicLayout({ children }: PublicLayoutProps) {
  return (
    <div className="public-layout">
      <main>{children}</main>

      <Footer
        onChatOpen={() => {
          window.dispatchEvent(
            new CustomEvent("hitech:open-chat")
          );
        }}
      />
    </div>
  );
}

```

## **5. Campus image**

Create this folder:

```
apps/web/public/images/campus/
```

Add your real college campus photograph as:

```
campus-students.jpg
```

The footer will display this image in the Contact Us column.

