## **7. Important production integrations**

| Feature                  | Integration required                 |
| ------------------------ | ------------------------------------ |
| Newsletter               | Express API + PostgreSQL             |
| Student login            | `/portal/login`                      |
| Staff login              | `/portal/staff/login`                |
| Account activation       | Invitation activation API            |
| Certificate verification | Verification module                  |
| Dr.IT chatbot            | Existing AI Support Centre           |
| Social media             | Official college URLs                |
| Accreditation            | Verify official registration details |

**Two important corrections before production:**

- The accreditation badges and registration number should only display verified institutional credentials. Do not use an ISO certification badge unless the college holds that certification.
- The newsletter currently provides the frontend interface. It needs a backend subscription endpoint before it can save subscribers.

## **8. Run the website**

```
cd apps/web
npm install
npm install lucide-react
npm run dev
```

Then inspect the footer at desktop, tablet and mobile widths.

